<h1>QUANTITATIVE AI TRADING ASSISTANT & TELEGRAM BOT</h1>
<p><strong>Full Technical Specification, Architecture, & Handoff Manual for AI Reviewers</strong></p>

<div class="highlight">
  <strong>Summary:</strong> This document contains the full architecture, quantitative logic, Smart Money Concepts (SMC) engine, multi-timeframe scoring algorithm, Telegram bot integration, and API catalog of the AI Trading System. You can directly share or paste this document into ChatGPT, Claude, or any LLM to explain the exact system implementation.
</div>

<h2>1. Executive System Overview</h2>
<p>This application is a 24/7 institutional-grade Quantitative Trading Engine and Autonomous Telegram Assistant built with <strong>React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS</strong> on the client and <strong>Node.js + Express</strong> on the server. The platform delivers high-probability trade setups across Crypto, Gold (XAU/USD), and Forex using live market feeds, institutional Smart Money Concepts (SMC), and Google Gemini AI.</p>

<h2>2. Full-Stack Architectural Blueprint</h2>
<pre>
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                CLIENT LAYER                                 |
|  React 18 + Tailwind CSS + Lucide Icons + Vite SPA                         |
|  - Precision Signal Analyzer & Dynamic Candlestick Chart View               |
|  - Quant & Macro Hub (MTF Matrix, Fear & Greed, Funding Squeeze, Backtest)  |
|  - Market Scanner (Multi-Asset Auto-Confluence Ranking)                     |
|  - Position Size & Risk Calculator (ATR-based Volatility Sizing)            |
|  - Live Telegram Simulator & 24/7 Diagnostics Log Stream                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                      |  HTTP & REST APIs
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                SERVER LAYER                                 |
|  Express.js (Node.js) on Port 3000                                          |
|  - /api/trading/overview, /api/trading/setup, /api/trading/smc              |
|  - /api/trading/sentiment, /api/trading/funding, /api/trading/backtest      |
|  - /api/trading/calendar, /api/trading/mtf                                  |
|  - /api/bot/status, /api/bot/logs, /api/bot/simulate-chat                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
         |                                       |                     |
+-------------------+                   +------------------+   +--------------+
|  QUANT TRADING    |                   | TELEGRAM BOT     |   | GEMINI AI    |
|  ENGINE           |                   | SERVICE          |   | ASSISTANT    |
|  (tradingEngine)  |                   | (telegramBot.ts) |   | (gemini.ts)  |
|  - SMC Detection  |                   | - Long Polling   |   | - Synthesis  |
|  - MTF Matrix     |                   | - Inline Buttons |   | - Trade R:R  |
|  - Backtesting    |                   | - 24/7 Alerts    |   | - Contextual |
|  - EMA/RSI/MACD   |                   | - Webhook Supp.  |   |   Reasoning  |
+-------------------+                   +------------------+   +--------------+
</pre>

