<h2>4. Algorithmic Trading Mechanics</h2>

<h3>A. Smart Money Concepts (SMC) Implementation</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fair Value Gaps (FVG):</strong> 3-candle imbalance pattern detection. Bullish FVG exists when <code>Candle[3].low &gt; Candle[1].high</code>. Bearish FVG exists when <code>Candle[3].high &lt; Candle[1].low</code>. Midpoint and mitigation states are tracked.</li>
  <li><strong>Order Blocks (OB):</strong> Identifies the final opposing candle before a strong displacement expansion (&gt;0.8% price move with high volume).</li>
  <li><strong>Liquidity Pools:</strong> Clusters swing highs and swing lows into buy-side (resting stop runs) and sell-side liquidity, flagging swept status when prices pierce the level.</li>
  <li><strong>Market Structure Shift:</strong> Evaluates Break of Structure (BOS) and Change of Character (CHoCH) for structural trend direction.</li>
</ul>

<h3>B. Multi-Timeframe (MTF) Alignment Matrix</h3>
<p>Simultaneously fetches 60 historical bars across <strong>15m, 1h, 4h, and 1D</strong> timeframes. Computes EMA(20), EMA(50), RSI(14), and MACD crossover values per timeframe to assign a 0–10 score and generate an overall confluence ratio (e.g. <code>4/4 Strong Buy Alignment</code>).</p>

<h3>C. Risk Management Rules</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Risk-to-Reward Ratio:</strong> Strictly enforced between 1:2.0 and 1:3.5.</li>
  <li><strong>Mathematical Stop-Loss:</strong> Placed beyond key swing points or calculated as <code>1.5 * ATR(14)</code> to avoid normal noise.</li>
  <li><strong>Tiered Take-Profits:</strong> TP1 (1.2x R:R - move SL to breakeven), TP2 (2.0x R:R - structural target), TP3 (3.0x+ R:R - trend runner).</li>
</ul>

